  "id": "superordinate-goal",
  "term": "superordinate goal",
  "definition": "A superordinate goal is the larger shared aim that multiple interdependent teams work together to achieve while also pursuing their own more immediate goals. It is the overarching objective that coordinates effort across teams.",
